here at Golden Horse.

4
00:00:10,402 --> 00:00:13,210
Our guest flew in from Saudi and knows his
cars.

5
00:00:13,559 --> 00:00:17,975
Salam, I'm Khalid. Been driving a while.

6
00:00:18,325 --> 00:00:19,957
Great to have you, Khalid.

7
00:00:20,307 --> 00:00:21,939
So, what brought you in?

8
00:00:22,289 --> 00:00:25,265
My steering wheel was cracked and
slippery.

9
00:00:25,615 --> 00:00:27,223
