13
00:00:33,974 --> 00:00:37,454
Online at golden‑horse dot ae, super easy.

14
00:00:37,804 --> 00:00:39,292
Walk us through arrival.

15
00:00:39,642 --> 00:00:44,322
Al Quoz 3, warehouse 4, clean and
organized.

16
00:00:44,672 --> 00:00:45,752
Professional vibe?

17
00:00:46,102 --> 00:00:51,022
Absolutely. Masters greeted me, explained
everything.

18
00:00:51,372 --> 00:00:52,524
What did they do?

19
00:00:52,874 --> 00:00:57,362
Full refurb — new leather wrap, stitching,
re‑foam.

20
00:00:57,712 --> 00:00:58,456
How long?

21
00:00:58,805 --> 00:01:01,301
A few hours, same day.

22
00:01:01,651 --> 00:01:02,467
Result?

23
00:01:02,817 --> 00:01:06,105
Feels brand new, grip is solid.

24
00:01:06,455 --> 00:01:07,967
Any surprises on price?

25
00:01:08,317 --> 00:01:12,853
Exactly 300 AED, no hidden fees.

26
00:01:13,203 --> 00:01:14,307
Communication?

27
00:01:14,657 --> 00:01:17,945
Clear, they showed before‑after photos.

28
00:01:18,295 --> 00:01:19,183
Trust factor?

29
00:01:19,532 --> 00:01:23,396
High. No pressure, just honest work.

30
00:01:23,746 --> 00:01:25,354
Relief after putting it off?

31
00:01:25,704 --> 00:01:29,064
Huge. Should've done it sooner.

32
00:01:29,414 --> 00:01:30,998
Perfect segue to Omar.

33
00:01:31,348 --> 00:01:36,244
Thanks. Quick tip: any warning light means
run an electrical diagnostic.

34
00:01:36,594 --> 00:01:38,586
Which lights should never be ignored?

35
00:01:38,936 --> 00:01:41,192
All of them — we can diagnose each.

36
00:01:41,542 --> 00:01:42,790
Service duel time.

37
00:01:43,139 --> 00:01:45,491
Fix now or wait on worn brake pads?

38
00:01:45,841 --> 00:01:47,785
Fix now — safety first.

39
00:01:48,135 --> 00:01:49,599
Wait if they're just squeaking?

40
00:01:49,949 --> 00:01:51,965
Squeak means wear, don't gamble.

41
00:01:52,315 --> 00:01:53,251
Fair point.

42
00:01:53,601 --> 00:01:54,513
Thanks for listening.

43
00:01:54,863 --> 00:01:57,839
Book your steering wheel refurb at
golden‑horse dot ae.

44
00:01:58,189 --> 00:01:59,221
